re-ins), `FLOAT_DTYPE` references = 107 (vs 13 remaining `np.float32` references all in places where float32 is intrinsically correct: `_D_LUT`, image RGB buffers, `mode_extra_w`, etc.). Two functional smoke tests pass clean with `filterwarnings('error', category=RuntimeWarning)`: B.1 voice catalog (21 voices, all selectors run, Stereo preset = 179 unique pixels = 100 + 80 − 1 overlap, unknown voice 99 fires `_et_fallback`) and B.5/B.7 CPU probe pass (∂I + std fractals at both float32 and float64, all dtypes match `FLOAT_DTYPE`, std-fractal `psi=1.0` and `p_dom=2.0` confirmed, `voice_pixel_map` indices in bounds, `probe_n_actual` bounded by max_iter and max_steps, np.errstate properly snapshotted/restored). Three Tools applied: **Identification** P (orbit position z_n every step every probe pixel) | D (per-step lattice projection + voice catalog + FLOAT_DTYPE trace dtype) | T (per-step traversal + GPU/CPU dispatcher); **Descriptor Gap closed** by all 8 sub-steps (voice catalog B.1 + probe kernels B.2/B.3 + F64 makers B.4 + CPU probe path B.5 + Finding 14 fix B.6 + dispatcher with `_render_frame` plumbing B.7); **Subsumption** zero remainder (every voice in plan §3.4 has a selector, every (P,D) tuple captured every step every probe, GPU and CPU backends are bit-equivalent first-class paths per plan §9 structural-branch exception, FLOAT_DTYPE precision matching covers both fractal precisions). Next action: Phase C (native music synthesis engine). |

